      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This issue seems still occurring at current build(1539). The above information is too old and obsolete, so I've made new post: https://feedback.vrchat.com/udon/p/1539-later-joiners-onvariablechanged-can-be-fired-before-start-if-the-object-own",
